<p>IHC CEO Syed Basar Shueb shared perspectives on leveraging AI as a strategic tool while reinforcing the importance of collaboration in navigating an increasingly dynamic business landscape.</p>
<p>The evening offered an opportunity to exchange insights, strengthen connections across the IHC ecosystem, and explore how technology and collaboration can support long term growth and value creation.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/f5c7d3a2-bdda-448c-b3a5-1d8555b649ed" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/f5c7d3a2-bdda-448c-b3a5-1d8555b649ed 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/f5c7d3a2-bdda-448c-b3a5-1d8555b649ed 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/f5c7d3a2-bdda-448c-b3a5-1d8555b649ed 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/f5c7d3a2-bdda-448c-b3a5-1d8555b649ed 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/f5c7d3a2-bdda-448c-b3a5-1d8555b649ed 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/f5c7d3a2-bdda-448c-b3a5-1d8555b649ed 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/f5c7d3a2-bdda-448c-b3a5-1d8555b649ed 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/f5c7d3a2-bdda-448c-b3a5-1d8555b649ed 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/f5c7d3a2-bdda-448c-b3a5-1d8555b649ed 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvgsl8 cyqkews cjor7zu clqywiz c1oinno0 swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ihc-uae_ihc-ifrs18-dynamicvaluenetworks-activity-7473067123032920064-9yRQ?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;rcm=ACoAAAJXMKkB-2IXzLIfgK_VLbk3iysAi_-ZJi0" target="_blank" class="w-link cr87vp0 c1rvept9 c1fac6ix c1uhc7w1 c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c15q2tiz c1u769m9 clvyd45 c17s4tu c160xww2"></a><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1u769m9 clvyd45 cxg6dvg c1lk4hdd c18haltn c1e81f34 c18706o7 c1l12vw1 caj1abu c6g7i4x c14gfnzn cphxpgl colzoh3 c1rk8kaw c2fuz54 c1vfh7rr ctaufhz"><div dir="ltr" class="w-box c1iamfq5 clvyd45 c1i89ytj"><div class="w-box c1kdvbvr c1ahti4x clvyd45 c9dwbsu c9iltle c1ppq7lb"><article data-ws-tag="article" class="w-box"><div class="w-html-embed ct2krqh c1n6wr2 c2670uy ctb44os c1rrcltf c7n31s7 c3kv3u4 c1i8bvmd c5eoy5p c1nuwhuu czb0xc5 ca87u6w c16tn9m0 c1s1fb22 cutb466 cgjf33v cproljm cz5mpju c1hqwrw3 c138bovi ci2tnaj cmypmql cxtln7p c139ibuz cio4b8c camt358 c19ri28p ch2vtix c1nqpryy ca71f8p c10l7pem c1njmai1 c104gaim c1lj4oo6 c13b2rnx c1jexxe4 cms1x9x cr6mc02 c5f1h85 cxfxj1v c14o65cf c19rfqa ciw7xd9 c1f0bzwq c1ype493 ca30ac2 c12sut5i c1idasj5 cebrknh c1xp0quz c12fxeyh"><p>The IHC Group came together today for a dedicated IFRS 18 workshop, bringing CFOs, Finance leaders, and teams from across our portfolio into one room.<br>&nbsp;<br>Delivered in collaboration with Grant Thornton - UAE, the session focused on the upcoming IFRS 18 requirements and their implications for financial reporting, performance presentation, systems, processes, and governance across a large and diverse group.<br>&nbsp;<br>Today&rsquo;s workshop provided a valuable platform to build a shared understanding of the changes, discuss implementation considerations, and strengthen readiness throughout the Group. Beyond the technical discussions, the workshop reflected the strength of IHC&rsquo;s finance cohesion, with colleagues aligning on a shared approach to reporting excellence.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/82426605-b77c-4d9a-8c44-f3d318f7bc08" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/82426605-b77c-4d9a-8c44-f3d318f7bc08 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/82426605-b77c-4d9a-8c44-f3d318f7bc08 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/82426605-b77c-4d9a-8c44-f3d318f7bc08 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/82426605-b77c-4d9a-8c44-f3d318f7bc08 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/82426605-b77c-4d9a-8c44-f3d318f7bc08 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/82426605-b77c-4d9a-8c44-f3d318f7bc08 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/82426605-b77c-4d9a-8c44-f3d318f7bc08 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/82426605-b77c-4d9a-8c44-f3d318f7bc08 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/82426605-b77c-4d9a-8c44-f3d318f7bc08 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvgsl8 cyqkews cjor7zu clqywiz c1oinno0 swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ihc-uae_ihc-commences-aed-18-billion-initial-purchase-activity-7471231391100293139-gihw?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;rcm=ACoAAAJXMKkB-2IXzLIfgK_VLbk3iysAi_-ZJi0" target="_blank" class="w-link cr87vp0 c1rvept9 c1fac6ix c1uhc7w1 c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c15q2tiz c1u769m9 clvyd45 c17s4tu c160xww2"></a><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1u769m9 clvyd45 cxg6dvg c1lk4hdd c18haltn c1e81f34 c18706o7 c1l12vw1 caj1abu c6g7i4x c14gfnzn cphxpgl colzoh3 c1rk8kaw c2fuz54 c1vfh7rr ctaufhz"><div dir="ltr" class="w-box c1iamfq5 clvyd45 c1i89ytj"><div class="w-box c1kdvbvr c1ahti4x clvyd45 c9dwbsu c9iltle c1ppq7lb"><article data-ws-tag="article" class="w-box"><div class="w-html-embed ct2krqh c1n6wr2 c2670uy ctb44os c1rrcltf c7n31s7 c3kv3u4 c1i8bvmd c5eoy5p c1nuwhuu czb0xc5 ca87u6w c16tn9m0 c1s1fb22 cutb466 cgjf33v cproljm cz5mpju c1hqwrw3 c138bovi ci2tnaj cmypmql cxtln7p c139ibuz cio4b8c camt358 c19ri28p ch2vtix c1nqpryy ca71f8p c10l7pem c1njmai1 c104gaim c1lj4oo6 c13b2rnx c1jexxe4 cms1x9x cr6mc02 c5f1h85 cxfxj1v c14o65cf c19rfqa ciw7xd9 c1f0bzwq c1ype493 ca30ac2 c12sut5i c1idasj5 cebrknh c1xp0quz c12fxeyh"><p>IHC has launched the first tranche of its second share buyback programme, allocating AED 1.8 billion for the repurchase of its shares.</p>
<p>The tranche represents 36% of the approved AED 5 billion programme and reflects IHC&rsquo;s strong financial position and confidence in its long-term growth trajectory. The announcement follows one of the strongest quarters in IHC&rsquo;s history, with revenue reaching AED 31.4 billion and profit after tax increasing 98.5% year-on-year to AED 8.2 billion.</p>
<p>Purchases will commence on 12 June 2026 in accordance with ADX regulations, with ongoing disclosures provided through ADX and IHC&rsquo;s website.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ea9e020b-8ca5-4024-bc47-8dbae6c82a70" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ea9e020b-8ca5-4024-bc47-8dbae6c82a70 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ea9e020b-8ca5-4024-bc47-8dbae6c82a70 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ea9e020b-8ca5-4024-bc47-8dbae6c82a70 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ea9e020b-8ca5-4024-bc47-8dbae6c82a70 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ea9e020b-8ca5-4024-bc47-8dbae6c82a70 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ea9e020b-8ca5-4024-bc47-8dbae6c82a70 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ea9e020b-8ca5-4024-bc47-8dbae6c82a70 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ea9e020b-8ca5-4024-bc47-8dbae6c82a70 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ea9e020b-8ca5-4024-bc47-8dbae6c82a70 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvgsl8 cyqkews cjor7zu clqywiz c1oinno0 swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ihc-uae_ihc-indiauae-activity-7468623653136396288-uSqh?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;rcm=ACoAAAJXMKkB-2IXzLIfgK_VLbk3iysAi_-ZJi0" target="_blank" class="w-link cr87vp0 c1rvept9 c1fac6ix c1uhc7w1 c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c15q2tiz c1u769m9 clvyd45 c17s4tu c160xww2"></a><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1u769m9 clvyd45 cxg6dvg c1lk4hdd c18haltn c1e81f34 c18706o7 c1l12vw1 caj1abu c6g7i4x c14gfnzn cphxpgl colzoh3 c1rk8kaw c2fuz54 c1vfh7rr ctaufhz"><div dir="ltr" class="w-box c1iamfq5 clvyd45 c1i89ytj"><div class="w-box c1kdvbvr c1ahti4x clvyd45 c9dwbsu c9iltle c1ppq7lb"><article data-ws-tag="article" class="w-box"><div class="w-html-embed ct2krqh c1n6wr2 c2670uy ctb44os c1rrcltf c7n31s7 c3kv3u4 c1i8bvmd c5eoy5p c1nuwhuu czb0xc5 ca87u6w c16tn9m0 c1s1fb22 cutb466 cgjf33v cproljm cz5mpju c1hqwrw3 c138bovi ci2tnaj cmypmql cxtln7p c139ibuz cio4b8c camt358 c19ri28p ch2vtix c1nqpryy ca71f8p c10l7pem c1njmai1 c104gaim c1lj4oo6 c13b2rnx c1jexxe4 cms1x9x cr6mc02 c5f1h85 cxfxj1v c14o65cf c19rfqa ciw7xd9 c1f0bzwq c1ype493 ca30ac2 c12sut5i c1idasj5 cebrknh c1xp0quz c12fxeyh"><p>The UAE and India have never been closer and IHC is proud to be part of that story.</p>
<p>H.E. Mariam bint Mohammed Almheiri, Vice Chair and Managing Director of 2PointZero Group, represented IHC at the Adani Group Annual Conference in Mumbai, sharing her perspective on one of the world's most dynamic and consequential economic partnerships.</p>
<p>Speaking on the panel, The India Bet: How Long-Term Capital Will Shape the USD 10 Trillion Blueprint, H.E. highlighted the role of patient capital, strategic investment, and trusted partnerships in supporting India's next phase of growth.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/e8c4ad02-07bd-432f-829b-e6d428db25fc 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvgsl8 cyqkews cjor7zu clqywiz c1oinno0 swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ihc-uae_ihc-uaepledge-activity-7468274195290918914-blOe?utm_source=share&amp;utm_m