<p>The ranking evaluates 1,000 companies worldwide based on revenue growth, financial strength, and stock performance, recognizing organizations that have demonstrated sustained growth and long-term value creation.</p>
<p>We&rsquo;re also proud to see several of our group companies recognized among the world&rsquo;s leading growth companies: Emirates Stallions Group ranked #35, 2PointZero Group #36, NMDC Group #71, APEX Investment P.S.C #98, Response Plus Holding PJSC #254, Alpha Dhabi Holding #329, Easy Lease Motorcycle Rental PSC #387, Ghitha Holding #429, and Invictus Investment Company PLC #860.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/6396e0ce-131a-4105-af0d-de3d5837d52f" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/6396e0ce-131a-4105-af0d-de3d5837d52f 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/6396e0ce-131a-4105-af0d-de3d5837d52f 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/6396e0ce-131a-4105-af0d-de3d5837d52f 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/6396e0ce-131a-4105-af0d-de3d5837d52f 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/6396e0ce-131a-4105-af0d-de3d5837d52f 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/6396e0ce-131a-4105-af0d-de3d5837d52f 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/6396e0ce-131a-4105-af0d-de3d5837d52f 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/6396e0ce-131a-4105-af0d-de3d5837d52f 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/6396e0ce-131a-4105-af0d-de3d5837d52f 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvgsl8 cyqkews cjor7zu clqywiz