w-box"><div class="w-html-embed ct2krqh c1n6wr2 c2670uy ctb44os c1rrcltf c7n31s7 c3kv3u4 c1i8bvmd c5eoy5p c1nuwhuu czb0xc5 ca87u6w c16tn9m0 c1s1fb22 cutb466 cgjf33v cproljm cz5mpju c1hqwrw3 c138bovi ci2tnaj cmypmql cxtln7p c139ibuz cio4b8c camt358 c19ri28p ch2vtix c1nqpryy ca71f8p c10l7pem c1njmai1 c104gaim c1lj4oo6 c13b2rnx c1jexxe4 cms1x9x cr6mc02 c5f1h85 cxfxj1v c14o65cf c19rfqa ciw7xd9 c1f0bzwq c1ype493 ca30ac2 c12sut5i c1idasj5 cebrknh c1xp0quz c12fxeyh"><p>Daud Farooq, IHC&rsquo;s Group General Counsel, joined industry leaders at the Forbes Middle East Top Advisors &amp; Investors Summit in Abu Dhabi to discuss the critical role of governance and legal certainty in attracting long-term capital.</p>
<p>During a fireside chat, Daud highlighted how forward-looking legal frameworks, predictability, and strong institutional enforcement are increasingly defining where global investors choose to deploy capital. As markets compete for international investment, trust, transparency, and disciplined governance are becoming essential enablers of sustainable growth.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/c858f745-9dc5-4efd-bd8a-81f011994508" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/c858f745-9dc5-4efd-bd8a-81f011994508 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/c858f745-9dc5-4efd-bd8a-81f011994508 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/c858f745-9dc5-4efd-bd8a-81f011994508 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/c858f745-9dc5-4efd-bd8a-81f011994508 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/c858f745-9dc5-4efd-bd8a-81f011994508 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/c858f745-9dc5-4efd-bd8a-81f011994508 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/c858f745-9dc5-4efd-bd8a-81f011994508 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/c858f745-9dc5-4efd-bd8a-81f011994508 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/c858f745-9dc5-4efd-bd8a-81f011994508 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvgsl8 cyqkews cjor7zu clqywiz c1oinno0 swiper-slide"><a