5-f58j?utm_source=social_share_send&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop_web&amp;rcm=ACoAAAJXMKkB-2IXzLIfgK_VLbk3iysAi_-ZJi0" target="_blank" class="w-link cr87vp0 c1rvept9 c1fac6ix c1uhc7w1 c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c15q2tiz c1u769m9 clvyd45 c17s4tu c160xww2"></a><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1u769m9 clvyd45 cxg6dvg c1lk4hdd c18haltn c1e81f34 c18706o7 c1l12vw1 caj1abu c6g7i4x c14gfnzn cphxpgl colzoh3 c1rk8kaw c2fuz54 c1vfh7rr ctaufhz"><div dir="ltr" class="w-box c1iamfq5 clvyd45 c1i89ytj"><div class="w-box c1kdvbvr c1ahti4x clvyd45 c9dwbsu c9iltle c1ppq7lb"><article data-ws-tag="article" class="w-box"><div class="w-html-embed ct2krqh c1n6wr2 c2670uy ctb44os c1rrcltf c7n31s7 c3kv3u4 c1i8bvmd c5eoy5p c1nuwhuu czb0xc5 ca87u6w c16tn9m0 c1s1fb22 cutb466 cgjf33v cproljm cz5mpju c1hqwrw3 c138bovi ci2tnaj cmypmql cxtln7p c139ibuz cio4b8c camt358 c19ri28p ch2vtix c1nqpryy ca71f8p c10l7pem c1njmai1 c104gaim c1lj4oo6 c13b2rnx c1jexxe4 cms1x9x cr6mc02 c5f1h85 cxfxj1v c14o65cf c19rfqa ciw7xd9 c1f0bzwq c1ype493 ca30ac2 c12sut5i c1idasj5 cebrknh c1xp0quz c12fxeyh"><p>IHC and Global Citizen, the world&rsquo;s largest movement to end extreme poverty, announced a new multi-year strategic partnership at the IHC House during the World Economic Forum Annual Meeting in Davos.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Under the partnership, IHC will support Global Citizen&rsquo;s advocacy efforts and global programming, including existing initiatives and the development of new engagements, particularly in the UAE and Middle East. The collaboration reflects Global Citizen&rsquo;s and IHC&rsquo;s shared commitment to supporting platforms that mobilize governments, businesses, and citizens to eradicate extreme poverty.&nbsp;</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ede03d1f-2cf2-4646-99c3-c2b8e2f4561f" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ede03d1f-2cf2-4646-99c3-c2b8e2f4561f 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ede03d1f-2cf2-4646-99c3-c2b8e2f4561f 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ede03d1f-2cf2-4646-99c3-c2b8e2f4561f 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ede03d1f-2cf2-4646-99c3-c2b8e2f4561f 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ede03d1f-2cf2-4646-99c3-c2b8e2f4561f 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ede03d1f-2cf2-4646-99c3-c2b8e2f4561f 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ede03d1f-2cf2-4646-99c3-c2b8e2f4561f 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ede03d1f-2cf2-4646-99c3-c2b8e2f4561f 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/ede03d1f-2cf2-4646-99c3-c2b8e2f4561f 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvg