<p>The discussion explored long-term value creation, institutional resilience, and sustainable growth, highlighting the importance of responsible stewardship and enduring partnerships across global markets.</p></div></article></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="w-box cth07qy ci5wkz cxz461o ck0dm8r ctsg2zi c1egf35l c1wp6k3u c1ypluku"><div class="w-box c1wp6k3u c1rutdfz c1e5m8wd cdavepk c1l12vw1 c1e7xojf c1ptd99z c1isp952 cqll2gw ckvf04m"></div></div></div><img alt="" src="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/4804455a-a372-496e-a769-a695370ecc29" class="w-image c1rcq9ql c16wrs7f c19mvwms cth07qy c1oq0bg0 cj905e4 c1g5uytj cdn8nqx c1uylicj c1u769m9 clvyd45 c1hb0b7r c1isoarp" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/4804455a-a372-496e-a769-a695370ecc29 384w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/4804455a-a372-496e-a769-a695370ecc29 640w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/4804455a-a372-496e-a769-a695370ecc29 750w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/4804455a-a372-496e-a769-a695370ecc29 828w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/4804455a-a372-496e-a769-a695370ecc29 1080w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/4804455a-a372-496e-a769-a695370ecc29 1200w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/4804455a-a372-496e-a769-a695370ecc29 1920w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/4804455a-a372-496e-a769-a695370ecc29 2048w, https://pub-a30c952d0179457fbf8fc3c73b51d5cf.r2.dev/image/4804455a-a372-496e-a769-a695370ecc29 3840w" decoding="async" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="w-box c1iamfq5 c1p3xvq5 ccrfqwg c1s9iaxs c1sqzdis c3kpltt c14ul3bf c1p13c68 ctvgsl8 cyqkews cjor7zu clqywiz c1oinno0 swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ihc-uae_ihc-ihchouse-wef26-activity-7420058196398194688-vc9r?utm_source=social_share_send&amp;utm_medium=member_deskt